<title>SRI LANKA: Sampath Bank 3-month net up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Sampath Bank 3-month net up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Sampath Bank Ltd for the three months ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(In millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				 1997		 1996</p>
<p>    Turnover		534.75    vs     426.52</p>
<p>    Net profit	     75.20    vs	59.98</p>
<p>    Tax provision	  40.49    vs	32.29</p>
<p>NOTE - Sampath Bank Ltd is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
